      <section eId="sec_1-101">
        <num>1-101</num>
        <heading>Application of chapter</heading>
        <paragraph eId="sec_1_101__p_1" class="indent-1">
          <content>
            <p>In the construction of statutes, the rules set out in this chapter shall be observed, unless such construction is inconsistent with the manifest intent of the General Assembly or repugnant to the context of the same statute.</p>
          </content>
        </paragraph>
      </section>
